			"notes": "# Furnitures O' Plenty 1.2.1\n\nFurnitures O' Plenty 1.2.1 is a bug-fix release for Minecraft 1.20.1 on Forge and Fabric.\n\n## Fixed\n\n- Fixed food and other items placed on Biomes O' Plenty Cutting Boards not rendering correctly.\n- Corrected the custom Cutting Board block entity registration, synchronization, and server ticking behavior.\n- Registered the Cutting Board renderer correctly on both Forge and Fabric.\n- Fixed missing or incorrect breaking particles on affected furniture and hedge variants by using the correct Biomes O' Plenty particle textures.\n\n## Compatibility\n\n- Minecraft 1.20.1\n- Forge 47.4.0 or newer, or Fabric Loader 0.16.10 or newer\n- Architectury API is required.\n- Biomes O' Plenty 19.0.0.90 or newer is required.\n- MrCrayfish's Furniture Mod: Refurbished 1.0.14 or newer is required.\n\n## Upgrade note\n\nIf a Cutting Board placed in 1.2.0 still appears empty after upgrading, break and replace the board so it uses the corrected block entity type."
		},
