			"notes": "# Furnitures O' Plenty 1.1.2\n\n## 🛠️ Fixes\n\n* Fixed an issue where Backpacked-related features could cause problems when Backpacked was not installed.\n* Improved compatibility for installations that do not include Backpacked.\n* Corrected optional dependency handling for Backpacked integration.\n\n## 📋 Notes\n\n* Backpacked remains an optional dependency.\n* No new content has been added in this update.\n* Existing worlds are safe to update.\n\nThank you for your continued support of Furnitures O' Plenty! 🪑✨"
