			"notes": "# 🎒 Furnitures O' Plenty 1.1.1\n\nA new compatibility-focused update for Furnitures O' Plenty, bringing support for MrCrayfish's Backpacked and introducing a brand new decorative storage furniture set for every Biomes O' Plenty wood type.\n\n## ✨ New Features\n\n### 🎒 Backpacked Compatibility\n\nFurnitures O' Plenty now includes compatibility with MrCrayfish's Backpacked!\n\nIntegrate your backpack collection into your builds and storage rooms with new decorative furniture designed specifically for backpack storage and display.\n\n### 🪵 New Furniture Type: Backpack Shelf\n\nAdded Backpack Shelves for all supported Biomes O' Plenty wood types.\n\nDisplay and organize your backpacks in style with shelves that match the aesthetic of your favorite wood set.\n\nAvailable for:\n\n* Fir\n* Pine\n* Maple\n* Redwood\n* Mahogany\n* Jacaranda\n* Palm\n* Willow\n* Dead\n* Magic\n* Umbran\n* Hellbark\n* Empyreal\n\n## 🎨 Building & Decoration\n\nBackpack Shelves expand the decorative and functional furniture options available for Biomes O' Plenty builders, making storage rooms, workshops, houses, stations, and community buildings feel more complete and immersive.\n\n## 🔧 Compatibility Improvements\n\n* Added integration with MrCrayfish's Backpacked.\n* Improved cross-mod building possibilities.\n* Expanded the available furniture collection for every supported wood type.\n\n## 📦 Summary\n\nThis update focuses on improving mod compatibility and expanding furniture variety across the entire Furnitures O' Plenty lineup.\n\nThank you to everyone downloading, testing, and supporting Furnitures O' Plenty!\n\nHappy building! 🏡✨"
		},
