			"notes": "# 🪑 Furnitures O’ Plenty 1.1.0\n\n# ✨ OFFICIAL RELEASE!!!\n\n## ✨ Rendering & Visual Fixes Update\n\nThis update focuses on improving rendering consistency, visual polish, and overall block behavior across multiple furniture types.\n\n---\n\n## 🌊 Water Rendering Fixes\n\nResolved various rendering issues involving water behavior and transparency on:\n\n- 🚰 Kitchen Sinks\n- 🛁 Baths\n- 🪣 Basins\n- 🚽 Toilets\n\n---\n\n## 🧱 Occlusion & Texture Rendering Improvements\n\nFixed visual occlusion issues and texture rendering inconsistencies on:\n\n- 🏺 Storage Jars\n- 🌿 Lattice Fence Gates\n- 🌿 Lattice Fences\n\n---\n\n## 🌀 Ceiling Fan Rendering Fixes\n\nResolved fan blade rendering problems affecting:\n\n- 💡 Light Ceiling Fans\n- 🌑 Dark Ceiling Fans\n\n---\n\n## 💡 Ceiling Fan Lighting Fixes\n\nFixed an issue where ceiling fan lights would fail to properly activate when powered or right-clicked:\n\n- 💡 Light Ceiling Fans\n- 🌑 Dark Ceiling Fans\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 General Improvements\n\n- ✅ Improved rendering consistency across multiple furniture blocks\n- ✨ Enhanced visual behavior for transparent and animated models\n- 🛠️ Additional polish and stability improvements\n\nThanks for supporting Furnitures O’ Plenty and seeing it becoming into official release from beta! ❤️"
		}
